ex:Ev_Page_Ch23 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch23"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch23" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.35.0 of chapter 23 (Controlling the Keyboard and Mouse), template 9.49.0, builder 4.17.0, NEW test 9.33.0 (test 9.32.0 failed on this chapter because no concept example can run in a browser; 9.33.0 has six documented changes, none removing an assertion: parse-tree zoom skipped with a note when no example runs; follow-up check drops the 'for example:' requirement then; playground option list handles generic template options; Code Lab asserts no same/DIFFERENT line after 15 s; ERD drag moves towards the diagram centre; at least 4 exercises when nothing runs), page-data 2.21.0, course_page_config 1.18.0, materials register 1.52.0. Reported by the building agent: page test in headless Chromium twice: 376 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped each run, one NOTE line (no parse-tree diagram to zoom); 104 knowledge-graph widgets tested and passed; no console errors, 0 dialogs, 104 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none. Gates against the pinned ecosystem OVERALL PASS; the checks script gave 91 checks with 1 mismatch on the first run and 0 on the second: the research example ClickSequence stores a Motion-event count of 3 on the virtual display and re-ran as 2, a timing-dependent value; the research was NOT revised (a v1_0_3 stabilising it is open). 12 quiz items CO1-CO5. All 74 concept examples are 'Recorded, not run on this page' with reasons (no X server, input devices or process start in a browser); nothing embedded. Six deck pictures embedded, decode in Chromium, not viewed on the page. Deck labels reproduced (NOT EXECUTED slides 5, 8, 14, 17, 22, 23; Recorded on the 14 listed slides; virtual display, not a real screen). The lineage session did not re-run the page test. OPEN LICENCE QUESTIONS for the owner: the book's online materials (zip); the MouseInfo window picture. Not verified: exam release with the real key; live LLM; Chrome and Safari; Windows and macOS; a real display and input devices; Python 3.14.7+/3.15; earlier pages under test 9.33.0; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.35.0 committed in 6bd1869; research package unchanged at 1.0.2." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py and Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-14T08:08:51"^^xsd:dateTime .
