ex:Ev_Research_Threads a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Research Threads"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Research/Threads" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Subject Threads (multithreading, 2nd edition chapter 17; file slot 25) RDODI Stages 1-3. Re-run by the lineage session against the pinned ecosystem 89f68596: Stage1.A 925 triples, Stage2.A 392, Stage3.A 746, Stage3.F all claims cited and 74 citations verified, Stage3.src 92 real-sourced 0 invalid, OVERALL PASS. Reported by the building agent: 74 sources, 25 findings, 64 executed leaves, checks script 83 checks 0 mismatches, HermiT consistent, 7 diagrams, 4 stories. Findings on the 2e chapter: as printed, Step 2 never calls start() (RuntimeError on join); with start() the downloader skips comics 9, 19, 29 because of range(start, end); the prose and listing disagree on the sep string. Free-threaded Python build installed and ran (GIL flag False; lost updates on a shared counter observed there, none on GIL builds in 12 runs); timings are single runs on 2 CPUs taken when the one-minute load average was below 1.0. NOT EXECUTED: free-threaded Python 3.13, a C extension re-enabling the GIL, Windows and macOS thread behaviour, more than 2 CPUs, the real xkcd.com (a local stand-in server was used), runs under load. Stated deviations: the thirdparty replay, interpreter and corpus-base scripts of chapter 24 were not written, their content being covered by the leaves and two JSON records; leaf prose is less hand-written than chapter 23's." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates re-run by the lineage session over the research package committed in 5fedc45 (v1_0_0, file slot ch25)." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (rdodi-ecosystem/02-gates/rdodi_pipeline_validator_v1_6_0.py, Stages 1-3, ecosystem pinned at 89f68596), sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py (Python 3.14.x; HermiT)" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-14T08:09:51"^^xsd:dateTime .
