sual result), D4 (12 of 27 key concepts have an analogy), D5 (0 of 4 story slides complete), D7 (25 slides with notes over 60 words, longest 240), D10 (0 of 3 dividers complete), D11 (15 of 27 concepts on a slide = 55.6 percent); D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Chapter 7 (03-materials/ch07/SEN0414_Ch07_Dictionaries_3e_v1_0_0.pptx): 26 slides, 9 code slides, 1 native chart, 34 concepts; D1, D2 (longest 130 words), D3 (0 of 9), D4 (0 of 34), D5 (0 of 4), D7 (longest note 168 words), D11 (17 of 34 = 50.0 percent) fail; D10 not measured (no divider found); D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Chapter 8 (the only deck, 08-tooling/ch08-deck/sen0414_ch08_deck_v1_0_0.pptx; 03-materials/ch08 holds no deck): 25 slides, 13 code slides, 0 native charts, 57 concepts; D1, D2 (longest 90 words), D3 (0 of 13), D4 (0 of 57), D5 (0 of 4), D7 (longest note 140), D11 (31 of 57 = 54.4 percent) fail; D10 not measured; D6, D8, D9, D12 pass. Discrepancy to be settled by the independent tool and not adjusted: the owner's own measurement of the chapter 8 deck reported a failure of D8 (resources slide); the port reads D8 PASS (a resources slide, slide 24, with 11 external links). PAGES (the shipped pages sen0414_chNN_page_v9_28_0.html, template line 9.50.0, page test 9.34.0). None of the three pages has a chapter-code tab (0 elements with data-pane chaptercode or data-cc-item), none has a panel level (0 elements with data-panel), none declares the page standard (no meta page-standard); at the first view the page does not scroll sideways at 390 px or at 1366 px (scrollWidth equals clientWidth in both), so the P1 overflow measure is not among the findings of this reading; the other page measures (P2 to P11) are taken by the page test the second task writes. TOOLS. The SEN0414 line has the template 9.50.0 (course_page_template_v9_50_0.html), the page builder v4_17_0, the page-data builder v2_24_0 and the page test 9.34.0 (with the exam-release checks, run by sen0414_page_test_run_v1_0_0.py against a TEST release key); it has no deck standard check, no deck overlap check and no chapter-code tab. The sibling course SEN0401 holds the finished versions of all of these (deck standard check v1_0_0, deck overlap check v1_0_0, page test 9.36.0, template 9.52.1, page builder v4_15_0, page-data builder v2_24_0), from the same ancestry as this line; they are ported as new-named copies, never edited. The chapter check v1_1_0 of this register reads the build checks of chapters 7 to 12 (chapter 6 has no entry in it)." .

