ex:Iter_18 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 18: the chapter 6, 7 and 8 decks and interactive pages brought to the written standard"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_18" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:iterationStart "2026-10-23T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:iterationEnd "2026-10-30T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "Proposed by the lineage agent on 2026-10-23T06:59:32: the start is the instant of the planning ceremony ex:PC2_Iter_18; the length is 7 days, constant from this iteration on (G9) - a stipulation, not a measurement: it is the class cadence (the iteration ends before the Friday class at 14:00 Istanbul, here 2026-10-30T06:59:32), and the iterations of the first lineage had no constant length (their ends lay one to seven weeks out), so this length is the lineage agent's proposal for the owner to confirm or change. Justification of the work inside it (estimates, not measurements). At T0 the three tooling tasks and the three deck builds are independent builds with python-pptx and light rendering: the deck check about 1.5 h, the page test about 3 h, the template and builders about 5 h, each deck about 5 h. The heavy part is the browser tests, which run one at a time on the two cores. CRITICAL PATH per chapter: deck (5 h) -> its verification (0.5 h) -> page (about 3 h, also needs the template and the page test) -> its verification (about 1 h). Chapter 6: page ready about T0+9.5 h; chapter 7 starts its page 1.5 h later and chapter 8 3 h later because their tests queue behind the earlier ones: about T0+11 h and T0+12.5 h if nothing fails. The margin to the end of the iteration is several days, enough for repeated page tasks; the urgency is the owner's, so the order is chapter 6 first and each chapter ships as soon as it is controlled." ;
    backlog:hasSprintGoal "The decks and the interactive pages of chapters 6, 7 and 8 are rebuilt as new files that meet the written teaching-material standard (the deck standard D1 to D12 and the page standard P1 to P11), measured by an independent deck check and the page test 9.36.0 and verified by the evidence bridge, chapter 6 first, then 7, then 8; the slide code of each chapter appears in the same order in the chapter-code tab of its page and runs there. Each unit that fails is named failing and is not Done. No existing file, gate, test or threshold is edited. Frozen at the planning ceremony." ;
    backlog:hasMember ex:ST_Std_DeckTools, ex:ST_Std_PageTools, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch06, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch06, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch07, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch07, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch08, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch08, ex:TK_Std_DeckCheck, ex:TK_Std_PageTest, ex:TK_Std_Template, ex:TK_Std_Regress, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch06_Build, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch06_Verify, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch07_Build, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch07_Verify, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch08_Build, ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch08_Verify, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch06_Build, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch06_Verify, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch07_Build, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch07_Verify, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch08_Build, ex:TK_Std_Page_Ch08_Verify .
ex:PB2S_Iter_18 a backlog:PlanBaseline ; rdfs:label "Plan baseline of iteration 18 when it was planned"@en ; backlog:baselineFor ex:Iter_18 ; backlog:baselinedAt "2026-10-23T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:isCurrentBaseline true ; backlog:hasBaselineStart "2026-10-23T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasBaselineEnd "2026-10-30T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:PC2_Iter_18 a backlog:SprintPlanningCeremony ; rdfs:label "Planning of iteration 18: the chapter 6, 7 and 8 standard"@en ; backlog:ceremonyFor ex:Iter_18 ; backlog:heldAt "2026-10-23T06:59:32"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:includesPlanningEvent ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_DeckTools, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_PageTools, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Deck_Ch06, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Page_Ch06, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Deck_Ch07, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Page_Ch07, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Deck_Ch08, ex:Plan2S_ST_Std_Page_Ch08 ;
    rdfs:comment "Held 2026-10-23T06:59:32 by the lineage agent, after the owner's request of Friday 2026-10-23 08:57 Istanbul (05:57 UTC) (ex:CR2_Standard): the eight stories and their 16 tasks are committed to this iteration, whose goal is frozen at its start. No executor has started; work begun is recorded at the real start of each executor session, with its brief."@en .
ex:SC2_Standard a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Scope grown by the chapter 6, 7 and 8 decks and pages brought to the written standard, and the tools that measure it"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest ex:CR2_Standard ; backlog:changesScope ex:Scope2 ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:ST_Std_DeckTools, ex:ST_Std_PageTools, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch06, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch06, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch07, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch07, ex:ST_Std_Deck_Ch08, ex:ST_Std_Page_Ch08 ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "Owner's request of Friday 2026-10-23 08:57 Istanbul (05:57 UTC), relayed by the course coordinator in the assignment to the lineage agent and recorded here as relayed (a statement of its content, not a verbatim quotation, because the lineage agent holds the assignment, not a transcript of the owner's message): the PPT decks and interactive HTML pages of SEN0414 chapters 6 (Lists), 7 (Dictionaries) and 8 must meet the same standards as the sibling course SEN0401 chapters 5 and 6 just delivered, especially that the code on the slides appears exactly, in the same order, in a special 'chapter code' tab of the page that can run it. The request is urgent: the owner's class material is needed as soon as possible, and decks and pages ship chapter by chapter as each is controlled. The request is direction from the owner and authorises the scope; the length of the iteration remains his to decide. Under the standing rule that work following the owner's direction is recorded as owner-directed, it is not listed as an open owner confirmation. The boundary moved outward by eight stories; the exclusion of any rebuild (ex:Excl2_NoRebuild) is lifted only for the new files named in ex:Del2_StdTools, ex:Del2_StdDecks and ex:Del2_StdPages; nothing existing is edited or weakened." .
ex:CR2_Standard rdfs:comment "Disposition set to Accepted on 2026-10-23 in the version that records the ScopeChange ex:SC2_Standard and the eight stories it admits; it was Pending before. The owner's request of Friday 2026-10-23 08:57 Istanbul (05:57 UTC) is the direction and authorises the scope; the length of the iteration is still his."@en .

ex:Out2_BacklogR1 a backlog:StageOutput ;
    rdfs:label "Closure of the Backlog stage of the second lineage, rebuilt by the stage revision for the teaching-material standard of chapters 6 to 8"@en ;
