er): a retrofit of one chapter is about 10.0 h of work, about 9.0 h of it by executors; the 21 chapters 1 to 5 and 10 to 25 are about 210 h in all, about 70 h of wall time with three executor sessions in parallel (a deck session, a page session, a second chapter's deck session; the 2-core machine and the controller's control are the limit). Chapters still lacking research, deck or page after the retrofits are built from scratch at about 12.0 h each (research 3.0 h, deck 5.0 h, page 4.0 h); their list is measured when the retrofits finish. This story is the chapter 9 deck." .

