ex:TK_Std_Deck_Ch09_Build backlog:hasAuditNote "Chapter 9 facts for this task: the old deck is 08-tooling/ch09-deck/sen0414_ch09_deck_v1_0_0.pptx (with its generator, examples and checks in that folder); the research is 03-materials/ch09/rdodi (document v1_0_1, domain ABox and TBox, research v1_0_0); the old page is 03-materials/ch09/page/sen0414_ch09_page_v9_28_0.html. The new deck is a new file in 03-materials/ch09; use the chapter's stories (08-tooling/sen0414_ch09_stories_v1_0_0.py) and diagrams where they exist." .
