ex:Iter_19 a backlog:Iteration ; rdfs:label "Iteration 19 (planned, not started): the retrofit of chapters 1 to 5 and 10 to 25 to the standard, and the build of the remaining chapters"@en ; backlog:hasIdentifier "Iter_19" ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasDurationSource "PLANNED, NOT STARTED: no start, end or sprint goal is set; the iteration is planned with its own ceremony when the owner releases it after chapters 7, 8 and 9 (ex:CR2_Priority3)." .

ex:AC2F_Retrofit a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "A retrofitted chapter has a deck that meets the deck standard, its chapter-code manifest and a page that meets the page standard"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage2 ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "PLANNED, NOT STARTED (ex:CR2_Priority3). Given the old deck and old page of the chapter and its research, when the deck is rebuilt as a new file (deck standard check and overlap check pass, every element D1 to D12), the chapter-code manifest written from the deck, and the page rebuilt as a new file on the repaired template (page test 9.36.0 passes, the chapter-code tab equal to the manifest), then the chapter is retrofitted; the controller re-runs every check; no committed file is edited." ;
    backlog:measuredWithTool ex:TS2_DeckStdCheck, ex:TS2_DeckOverlap, ex:TS2_PageTest36 ;
    backlog:measuredWithVersion "deck standard check v1_0_0; deck overlap check v1_0_0; page test 9.36.0 through runner v1_1_0; template 9.52.2; builder 4.18.1; the versions then current when the chapter is planned into an iteration" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "the new files cited by SHA-256, the controller's own runs, verified by the evidence bridge" ;
    backlog:coveredByCase ex:TC2S_D_Passes, ex:TC2S_D_NotClaimed .

